*load* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''load(filename)''

Loads and executes a Chippy program.

*Parameters:*
- ''filename'': String path to Chippy program

*Returns:*
- ''ok'' on success

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if the file cannot be read, or if it fails to compile or execute

*Recommended Reading*

''chippy doc exit''
